From: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>
Date: Sun, 26 Jul 2026 17:18:22 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 041/117] dt-bindings: apple: describe T8010 PCIe Wi-Fi control

Describe the T8010 WLAN UART supplier, endpoint wake and regulator
controls, and the H9P port lifecycle properties needed by the J172
BCM4355 module. The host binding also permits the board-specific
apple,j172-pcie compatible while retaining apple,t8010-pcie as the
generic controller contract.

Allow max-link-speed = <1> on a root port to describe the real Gen1
endpoint contract. The property is a capability limit, not a request to
modify generic PCI retraining behavior.

Signed-off-by: Paul Praschl <praschlpaul@g-p.at>

Orchard-replay-of: 34a5b50b670c2a5ae0a6062cce7d118bee9ca784
